{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>To Him my mouth</b> — it lacks a bet, like: כי ששת ימים בפי קראתי (for six days I called with my mouth)." "<b>And exaltation</b> — and beyond \"exaltation,\" it was \"under my tongue\" — an allusion to the heart. And some say: the meaning is doubled, ורומם like ומורק ושוטף."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 66, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:32:55.656888589Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}